{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38109","headline":"太平谷中玩水上花 · 韩偓","name":"太平谷中玩水上花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山头水从云外落，水面花自山中来。\n一溪红点我独惜，几树蜜房谁见开。\n应有妖魂随暮雨，岂无香迹在苍苔。\n凝眸不觉斜阳尽，忘逐樵人蹑石回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}